  "reviews": [
    {
      "name": "places/ChIJtQmhjRf1aS4RRi1NEU73WBY/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2s0MlNWWkxUVXRvZDBKc01qUkdjM1J2WjNVdGRtYxAB",
      "relativePublishTimeDescription": "4 months ago",
      "rating": 5,
      "text": {
        "text": "A cafe you can call “safe space”. Definisi a perfect spot untuk wfc! I have visited this place quite sometimes sebelum renov dan sesudah renov, and I can tell this place is awesome! Musik yang ga ganggu, harga relatively murah dan enak, banyak colokan, staf yang ramah, dan comfy..\n\n1️⃣ Here are my orders:\n- Karage Salted Egg: definitely high above the standard. Gak kering, saus banyak, telur asin kerasa, perfect portion for one person. But is it the best salted egg? I fear not, tapi 100% recommended. (9/10)\n\n- Black Lemonade: A good balance between bitterness and tanginess. But I prefer a stronger coffee, but if you can’t tolerate strong/bitter coffee, you should try this one! It’s like an elevated version of cough syrup (in the best way possible) (8/10)\n\n- Axelle: What a taste! It’s like a berry americano (but the berry wasn’t too strong, it’s just a subtle taste) but infused with a floral sensation.. Delightful!! BESTT! (10/10)\n\n- Dirty Latte: for that price, enak sihh!! tapi creamnya terlalu manis (preferensiku) (8/10)\n\n2️⃣ Service\nSemua stafnya ramah and they really appreciate all critiques and feedback.. Jam malem, stafnya nanya per meja about their fnb and service! So nice!\n\n3️⃣ Ambiance\nLike I said before, it’s comfy, you can sit for more than 7 hours,, cocok!",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
      "originalText": {
        "text": "A cafe you can call “safe space”. Definisi a perfect spot untuk wfc! I have visited this place quite sometimes sebelum renov dan sesudah renov, and I can tell this place is awesome! Musik yang ga ganggu, harga relatively murah dan enak, banyak colokan, staf yang ramah, dan comfy..\n\n1️⃣ Here are my orders:\n- Karage Salted Egg: definitely high above the standard. Gak kering, saus banyak, telur asin kerasa, perfect portion for one person. But is it the best salted egg? I fear not, tapi 100% recommended. (9/10)\n\n- Black Lemonade: A good balance between bitterness and tanginess. But I prefer a stronger coffee, but if you can’t tolerate strong/bitter coffee, you should try this one! It’s like an elevated version of cough syrup (in the best way possible) (8/10)\n\n- Axelle: What a taste! It’s like a berry americano (but the berry wasn’t too strong, it’s just a subtle taste) but infused with a floral sensation.. Delightful!! BESTT! (10/10)\n\n- Dirty Latte: for that price, enak sihh!! tapi creamnya terlalu manis (preferensiku) (8/10)\n\n2️⃣ Service\nSemua stafnya ramah and they really appreciate all critiques and feedback.. Jam malem, stafnya nanya per meja about their fnb and service! So nice!\n\n3️⃣ Ambiance\nLike I said before, it’s comfy, you can sit for more than 7 hours,, cocok!",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
