    {
      "name": "places/ChIJtQmhjRf1aS4RRi1NEU73WBY/reviews/ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURGbS02X25BRRAB",
      "relativePublishTimeDescription": "2 years ago",
      "rating": 4,
      "text": {
        "text": "I admire the creativity for beverages, compare to their competitors nearby.\nWe ordered :\n- Lembayung 5/5\n- Iced Red Velvet 5/5\n- Mariani (If I'm not mistaken, The purple drink with lemongrass) 5/5\n\nAmbience 4/5 (common to industrial trends nowadays)\nService 4/5 (a bit long waiting time)\n\nUpdate march 2024 : I omit one star from previous 5 star, I came twice on sunday n next sunday but apparently they were closed. Inconsistent about openig hour.",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
